<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  You still need to finish onboarding before <%= @event.name %> can pay you for the <%= @position.title %> position.
  <% if @next_step.present? %>
    Your next step is: <strong><%= @next_step[:label] %></strong>.
  <% end %>
  This position runs through <strong><%= @position.end_date.to_fs(:long) %></strong>. You'll need to
  finish onboarding before then to be paid.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Click here", onboarding_payroll_position_url(@position) %> to review your position and complete any remaining steps.
</p>

<p>
  If you have any questions, please contact <%= @event.name %>.
</p>

<p>
  Sincerely,
  <br><br>
  The Fuime Team
</p>

